# Uncompressed source assets. These are the masters the shipped versions were
# encoded from, not files any page loads: bgvid.mp4 -> bgvid.webm (7.2MB -> 1.1MB)
# and bgimg.webp -> bgimg-hero.webp (4.4MB -> 184KB). Keeping them out of git
# avoids ~11MB of permanent history for bytes no visitor ever downloads; they
# still sit in the working tree for re-encoding.
docs/images/index/hero/bgvid.mp4
docs/images/index/hero/bgimg.webp
